21
00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:51.951
<v Maya>Yeah, exactly.</v>

22
00:02:51.971 --> 00:02:54.212
<v Daniel>But then you had projects like AutoCog.</v>

23
00:02:54.552 --> 00:02:55.172
<v Maya>Oh, wow, yeah.</v>

24
00:02:55.512 --> 00:02:56.633
<v Daniel>AutoCog was wild.</v>

25
00:02:56.873 --> 00:03:06.158
