41
00:04:35.308 --> 00:04:50.215
<v Maya>Oh, they brought in the absolute heavy hitters. We're talking Claude Opus 4.7 and 4.8, GPT 5.2 all the way through 5.6, Gemini 3.X, Quen, DeepSeek v4, Grok 4, Mistral, and even a custom-tuned GPT agent they</v>

